# Run 411 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# The harness is a read-only cross-ledger consistency verifier; it generates nothing
# under the repository tree. Any transient run output (summaries, reports) is written to a
# staging directory OUTSIDE the package tree (runner temp) and MUST NOT be committed.
# Only publish-safe OK/POSITIVE/NONE status lines appear in the tracked summary.
material/
node/
nodes/
logs/
data/
artifact-staging/
*.err
*.log
*.out
*.help.txt
*.usage.txt
*.kem.sk.bin
*.cert.bin
*.key
*.pem
metrics*.txt
*.generated.json
READINESS_CONTRADICTION_LEDGER_LINT_REPORT.json
READINESS_CONTRADICTION_LEDGER_LINT_REPORT.txt